Merda.

764
00:40:35,014 --> 00:40:36,127
Você abriu a janela?

765
00:40:36,127 --> 00:40:37,775
Abri.

766
00:41:07,863 --> 00:41:09,335
Merda.

767
00:41:09,335 --> 00:41:13,502
