777
00:41:41,479 --> 00:41:42,312
Porra!

778
00:41:44,279 --> 00:41:45,597
Oi. Alô.

779
00:41:45,597 --> 00:41:48,930
Minha esposa acabou de ligar,
vamos ficar na...

780
00:41:49,964 --> 00:41:51,602
Sim, minha esposa ligou.

781
00:41:51,602 --> 00:41:53,602
